WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Customer Segments”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Customer segments
Choose Customer segments and start creating a segment.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Set the conditions
Set the segment's conditions such as tags and the available data, and review the matching customers.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Save the segment
Save it with a clear name and check that the audience matches before using it in your campaign.
